{"path":"io/basic_ostream/seekp","title":"std::basic_ostream<CharT,Traits>::seekp","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_ostream&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>seekp","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream/seekp","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Sets the output position indicator of the current associated streambuf object.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">basic_ostream<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> seekp<span class=\"br0\">(</span> pos_type pos <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">basic_ostream<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> seekp<span class=\"br0\">(</span> off_type off, <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/seekdir\"><span class=\"kw1719\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">seekdir</span></span></a> dir <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Sets the output position indicator of the current associated <code>streambuf</code> object. \n</p>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx11\"><td>\n<p>Behaves as <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/UnformattedOutputFunction\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">UnformattedOutputFunction</em></a> (except without actually performing output). After constructing and checking the sentry object, \n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">fail<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>, sets the output position indicator to absolute (relative to the beginning of the file) value <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pos</span></code> by calling <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rdbuf<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>pubseekpos<span class=\"br0\">(</span>pos, <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><span class=\"kw1692\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">out</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>. In case of failure, calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">setstate<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/iostate\"><span class=\"kw1717\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">failbit</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">fail<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>, sets the output position indicator to offset <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">off</span></code> relative to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dir</span></code> by calling <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rdbuf<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>pubseekoff<span class=\"br0\">(</span>off, dir, <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/openmode\"><span class=\"kw1692\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">out</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>. In case of failure, calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">setstate<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/iostate\"><span class=\"kw1717\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">failbit</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> pos\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> absolute position to set the output position indicator to\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> off\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> relative position (positive or negative) to set the output position indicator to\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> dir\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> defines base position to apply the relative offset to. It can be one of the following constants:\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Constant\n</td>\n<td> Explanation\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/seekdir\"><code>beg</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> the beginning of a stream\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/seekdir\"><code>end</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> the ending of a stream\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/seekdir\"><code>cur</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> the current position of stream position indicator\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1,2)</span> May throw <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/failure\">std::ios_base::failure</a></span> in case of failure, if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">exceptions<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> failbit <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;sstream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostringstream\"><span class=\"kw1753\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostringstream</span></span></a> os<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"hello, world\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    os.<span class=\"me1\">seekp</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">7</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    os <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'W'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    os.<span class=\"me1\">seekp</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/seekdir\"><span class=\"kw1722\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">end</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    os <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'!'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    os.<span class=\"me1\">seekp</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    os <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'H'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> os.<span class=\"me1\">str</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Hello, World!</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue129\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 129</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td>there was no way to indicate a failure\n</td>\n<td>sets <code>failbit</code> on failure\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue136\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 136</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td><code>seekp</code> could set the input stream\n</td>\n<td>only sets the output stream\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue537\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 537</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td>1. the type of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pos</span></code> was <code>pos_type&amp;</code><br>2. the type of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">off</span></code> was <code>off_type&amp;</code>\n</td>\n<td>1. corrected to <code>pos_type</code><br>2. corrected to <code>off_type</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue2341\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 2341</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td>the resolution of <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue129\" data-external=\"1\">LWG issue 129</a> for overload (2) was removed\n</td>\n<td>restored\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream/tellp\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>tellp</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the output position indicator <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_istream/tellg\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>tellg</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the input position indicator <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_istream&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_istream/seekg\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>seekg</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  sets the input position indicator <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_istream&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_ostream","title":"std::basic_ostream"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_ostream<CharT,Traits>::seekp","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Sets the output position indicator of the current associated streambuf object."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"pos, off, dir","children":[{"label":"beg","note":"the beginning of a stream"},{"label":"end","note":"the ending of a stream"},{"label":"cur","note":"the current position of stream position indicator"}]},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw std::ios_base::failure in case of failure, if exceptions() & failbit != 0."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"tellp","note":"returns the output position indicator"},{"label":"tellg","note":"returns the input position indicator"},{"label":"seekg","note":"sets the input position indicator"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":341,"codeBlockCount":2}
